    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d558">

                <pb facs="0875" n="747" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg747"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">714.1515/704: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Summerlin</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-06-06T17:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 6, 1928—5
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 9:40 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>71. Your telegram number 44, June 4, 4 p.m.<anchor n="26" xml:id="d558-f1"/>
                    President Paz stated to me this afternoon that he has instructed the Minister
                    for Foreign Affairs to accept your proposal.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Guatemala.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
